sequenceDiagram
    participant Case as Pega Case
    participant DP as Data Page
    participant Conn as Connect-REST
    participant Auth as Auth Profile
    participant API as External REST API

    Case->>DP: Trigger integration
    DP->>Conn: Invoke connector
    Conn->>Auth: Get credentials / OAuth token
    Auth-->>Conn: Token
    Conn->>API: HTTP Request (GET/POST/PUT)
    alt Success 200
        API-->>Conn: JSON Response
        Conn-->>DP: Map to clipboard page
        DP-->>Case: Update case data
    else Error 4xx/5xx
        API-->>Conn: Error response
        Conn-->>DP: Error handler page
        DP-->>Case: Show error / retry
    end
